    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f2faccee1588fe784e1adc1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "工业制品特有的漂亮直线。\n看着与自然由来的直线不同的认真感――\n我也不由得挺直背脊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50870253fd423eb743d82655f6e8837a5ab67fe6c4c53297ee9737e2933770fd",
